{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17526","headline":"湖南观察使故相国袁公挽歌二首 二 · 权德舆","name":"湖南观察使故相国袁公挽歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹旐发江臯，人悲鴈亦号。\n湘南罢亥市，汉上改词曹。\n表墓双碑立，尊名一字襃。\n常闻平楚狱，爲报里门高。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}